<title>USA: Genrad sets buyback of up to 2 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Genrad sets buyback of up to 2 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>CONCORD, Mass. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>GenRad Inc said its board authorized the buyback of up to two million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>As of April 29, 1997, the company had 26,665,930 shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
</text>
